mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta携手傅利叶仅用三个月研发出人形机器人原型Max</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek开源Super-agent架构，引入经典计算机系统思想优化智能体</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团龙猫发布1.6万亿参数原生多模态模型LongCat-2.5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bf31e0caa224c84d5800eadd2a6f8ef2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团龙猫于11月2日发布LongCat-2.5，这是一款面向长程智能体任务的原生多模态模型，总参数量达1.6万亿，每token激活约480亿参数。该模型在LongCat-2.0基础上强化了原生视觉理解与智能体编程能力，目前已开放API接入，GitHub与HuggingFace权重即将上线。技术上，模型采用多层级离散token表示视觉信号，并支持视觉码本与主干联合学习。针对国产算力环境，LongCat-2.5优化了超节点并行与双重分片FSDP，长序列SFT单卡吞吐量较DDP提升86%。推理侧引入W4A4量化方案，相比W8A8基线，Prefill与Decode吞吐分别提升43.3%和42.77%。在Terminal Bench v4.0等评测中，该模型表现优异，其中Terminal Bench v4.0得分38.5</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布GPT-6.2 Astra与Anthropic曝光Claude 5.5系列旗舰模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4884ec035ee1189b4c1c1af2ae0d74e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI与Anthropic于11月初先后泄露其下一代旗舰模型，AI行业竞争进入白热化阶段。OpenAI跳过GPT-6.1，推出GPT-6.2 Astra，该模型已在Codex后台开启灰度测试，通过重构底层架构，解决了越权瞒报与实战偏科问题，支持自主拉起子进程连续工作数小时。Anthropic则在官网源码中曝光Claude 5.5系列，包含两个版本：特种安全版Mythos 5.5专供网安与科研机构，具备极强攻防能力，曾于53分钟内攻破Linux内核；大众通用版Fable 5.5支持100万Token超长上下文，单次提示词即可生成复杂3D工程作品。随着谷歌Gemini 4 Carbon此前登顶，硅谷三大巨头在11月初形成密集交锋，大模型技术迭代与性能上限再次被刷新，行业竞争节奏显著加快。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta携手傅利叶仅用三个月研发出人形机器人原型Max</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4a52fb32071ebcaa7e2befd2e8d1271f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta与中国机器人企业傅利叶达成合作，双方仅用三个月时间成功打造出代号为“Max”的人形机器人原型。该原型机高约1.5米，重约48千克，核心硬件搭载英伟达Jetson Thor芯片，配备可模拟人类表情的面部屏幕、扬声器及五指机械手，具备5米外声音识别与3米外手势理解能力。Meta首席技术官Andrew Bosworth将该机器人定位为消费级AI代理产品Muse的实体化形态。目前，双方已于9月正式启动第二代产品Max2的研发，计划升级躯干与机械手，并增设投影仪及楼梯传感器。Meta机器人业务产品副总裁Li-Chen Miller曾驻点上海工厂推进项目。此举标志着Meta正加速将软件Agent能力延伸至物理空间，深度布局消费级具身智能赛道。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek开源Super-agent架构，引入经典计算机系统思想优化智能体</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/31ad7bf053179e7d293d02d25e43572c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek Harness团队正式开源Super-agent架构，旨在通过引入计算机系统中的调度、缓存、存算分离及看门狗机制，突破传统单会话Agent在多任务并发与上下文管理上的瓶颈。该架构采用双层设计，由常驻Router层负责统一路由与交互，隔离的Worker层专注任务执行。核心模块包括两级过滤机制、异步全双工交互及“脑手分离”设计，支持智能体自主推进任务。实验数据显示，Super-agent在任务完成效率上表现显著，半数任务可在12.4分钟内完成，95%的任务在15.7分钟内完成。此外，订阅直通机制使Router层Token开销降低约37%，批处理机制将单次决定推理时间从6.4秒缩短至1.6秒。该架构通过系统层接管会话调度，为解决多任务智能体的效率与稳定性平衡提供了重要参考，目前已在GitHub开源。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
